#. module: databases_auth
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_databases_auth
msgid ""
"\n"
"Autoconnect to your SaaS client databases\n"
"============================================\n"
"\n"
"The Databases SaaS autoconnect module will help you to save time by allowing "
"you\n"
"to be directly authenticated into your SaaS client databases\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"自动连接到您的 SaaS 客户数据库\n"
"============================================\n"
"\n"
"数据库 SaaS 自动连接模块让您可以直接通过身份验证进入 SaaS 客户数据库，\n"
"从而帮助您节省时间\n"

